VALUES (311054, 'tt4125300', NULL, 'The Case of Hana & Alice', '花とアリス殺人事件', 'movie', 2015, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9zJ3Dx90DmOTeEMx5K6BQN9J0W.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ot1qNzXY5DAcTGbDdIWUS4Lahpo.jpg', 'After transferring to Ishinomori Middle School, Tetsuko "Alice" Arisugawa overhears her classmates discussing a strange rumor. The previous occupant of her seat, a nondescript "Judas," is missing and presumed murdered. Amidst dealing with her mother''s undesired meddling in her affairs and warding off her classmates'' bullying, the troubled Alice starts to investigate the mystery surrounding Judas'' disappearance. The trail of clues leads her to the house of her next-door neighbor, the quirky and reclusive Hana Arai.', NULL, NULL, 4.3362, 7.317, 0, 9.51, '2026-10-18 18:47:36', '2026-10-18 18:47:36')
