VALUES (1063574, 'tt32085997', NULL, 'Misericordia', 'Miséricorde', 'movie', 2024, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LVCXVdsGPPXRYGu5SRqgfVP96h.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/doFNxTRqDMCLitu838v5Ciuw0si.jpg', 'Jérémie returns to his hometown for the funeral of his former boss, the village baker. He decides to stay for a few days with Martine, the man''s widow. A mysterious disappearance, a threatening neighbor and a priest with strange intentions make Jérémie''s short stay in the village take an unexpected turn.', NULL, NULL, 3.6701, 6.371, 0, 9.01, '2026-10-18 18:47:36', '2026-10-18 18:47:36')
