VALUES (1771, 'tt0458339', NULL, 'Captain America: The First Avenger', 'Captain America: The First Avenger', 'movie', 2011, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSNxAJTlD0r02V9sPYpOjqDZXUK.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yFuKvT4Vm3sKHdFY4eG6I4ldAnn.jpg', 'During World War II, Steve Rogers is a sickly man from Brooklyn who''s transformed into super-soldier Captain America to aid in the war effort. Rogers must stop the Red Skull – Adolf Hitler''s ruthless head of weaponry, and the leader of an organization that intends to use a mysterious device of untold powers for world domination.', NULL, NULL, 21.0582, 7.01, 0, 1.01833333333333335e+01, '2026-07-20 01:02:04', '2026-10-18 18:47:36')
