VALUES (8810, 'tt0082694', NULL, 'Mad Max 2', 'Mad Max 2', 'movie', 1981, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1KVEhkGDpWRzQ0VqIhZqDDuOim.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/MMSI9WzRmOdqXarevQ3Kqnytrx.jpg', 'Max Rockatansky returns as the heroic loner who drives the dusty roads of a postapocalyptic Australian Outback in an unending search for gasoline. Arrayed against him and the other scraggly defendants of a fuel-depot encampment are the bizarre warriors commanded by the charismatic Lord Humungus, a violent leader whose scruples are as barren as the surrounding landscape.', NULL, NULL, 10.7277, 7.394, 0, 1.19728571428571424e+01, '2026-07-20 04:02:06', '2026-10-18 18:47:36')
