VALUES (10195, 'tt0800369', NULL, 'Thor', 'Thor', 'movie', 2011, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prSfAi1xGrhLQNxVSUFh61xQ4Qy.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cDJ61O1STtbWNBwefuqVrRe3d7l.jpg', 'Against his father Odin''s will, The Mighty Thor - a powerful but arrogant warrior god - recklessly reignites an ancient war. Thor is cast down to Earth and forced to live among humans as punishment. Once here, Thor learns what it takes to be a true hero when the most dangerous villain of his world sends the darkest forces of Asgard to invade Earth.', NULL, NULL, 29.2108, 6.772, 0, 10.535, '2026-08-19 01:49:52', '2026-10-18 18:47:36')
