VALUES (11310, 'tt0109439', NULL, 'City Slickers II: The Legend of Curly''s Gold', 'City Slickers II: The Legend of Curly''s Gold', 'movie', 1994, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gh0lsyJARglhpbKmnY8i8M7V5bI.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kuq99XpsY2wyI0yMMNjK5pTLafY.jpg', 'Mitch Robbins'' 40th birthday begins quite well until he returns home and finds his brother Glen, the black sheep of the family, in his sofa. Nevertheless he is about to have a wonderful birthday-night with his wife when he discovers a treasure map of Curly by chance. Together with Phil and unfortunately Glen he tries to find the hidden gold of Curly''s father in the desert of Arizona.', NULL, NULL, 2.0788, 5.331, 0, 8.53, '2026-08-19 01:49:52', '2026-10-18 18:47:36')
