VALUES (357411, 'tt3615204', NULL, 'Harmony', 'ハーモニー', 'movie', 2015, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UbCB4riPmrMxANyR3Zhd1176Nc.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eN58EQuzpi0NwZqaBKvqOUpIANP.jpg', 'Set in a future world. Japan has created a great medical technology that controls ethics, health, and social interaction to create a perfect world. Three young girls attempt to stand up to this by committing suicide, but it doesn''t work. Years later, Tuan, one of the girls who attempted suicide must prevent a crisis that threatens this "perfect" world.', NULL, NULL, 1.8721, 6.802, 0, 10.02, '2026-08-28 09:15:02', '2026-10-18 18:47:36')
