VALUES (38286, 'tt0135007', NULL, 'Three Men and a Leg', 'Tre uomini e una gamba', 'movie', 1997, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhgfM1WTHu4Uiwa47FAGmBk4V7x.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/43RcFOMa3NGsTw0VUOjkNRmYGbN.jpg', 'Friends Aldo, Giovanni, and Giacomo cross Italy from north to south for Giacomo''s wedding: the father of the bride, a despotic magnate who is both their boss and father-in-law—since Aldo and Giovanni have also married into the family not for love but for money, a fate now awaiting Giacomo—has entrusted them with a priceless piece of modern art, one that looks just like a rather unremarkable wooden leg.', NULL, NULL, 1.7315, 7.962, 0, 10.76, '2026-08-31 03:40:48', '2026-10-18 18:47:36')
